---
layout: layouts/shell.njk
permalink: /contact/
title: Contact
description: How to reach Mitch Gardner.
---
{% from "components/panel.njk" import panel %}

{# Every row is generated from site.profiles in _data/site.json. URLs, handles,
   and descriptions live there so nothing has to be updated in two places. #}

<main class="landing">
  {% call panel({
    variant: "page",
    title: "Contact",
    labelledBy: "contact-title",
    tabs: nav,
    currentUrl: page.url
  }) %}
    <p class="section-lead">
      The quickest way to reach me is GitHub or LinkedIn. Happy to talk about
      engineering roles, infrastructure work, open source, or any of the
      things on the rest of this site.
    </p>

    <ul class="link-list">
      {% for profile in site.profiles %}
        {% if profile.contact %}
      <li>
        <a class="link-row" href="{{ profile.url }}" rel="{% if profile.me %}me {% endif %}noopener">
          {% if profile.icon %}
          <svg class="link-row__icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-{{ profile.icon }}"/></svg>
          {% endif %}
          <span class="link-row__text">
            <span class="link-row__label">{{ profile.label }}</span>
            {% if profile.description %}
            <span class="link-row__desc">{{ profile.description }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            {% if profile.handle %}
            <span class="link-row__handle">{{ profile.handle }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </span>
        </a>
      </li>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% endcall %}
</main>
